      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "content": "先生，女士，谢谢你们让我们借宿一晚。还不知道该怎么称呼......？",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "麦尼尔先生",
            "content": "哼。告诉你也无妨。我家世世代代是挖矿的，我，就姓麦尼尔。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2351",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "content": "我是安洁莉娜。这是塔妮、嘉辛塔和阿梅利亚。我们准备横穿雷姆必拓这片土地，到南境去。也许，回程的路上我们还会相见的。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "麦尼尔先生",
            "content": "你们四个小姑娘，要走那么远的路？你们去干什么？！就算不怕天灾，难道也不怕路上的各种意外？",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2351",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "塔妮",
            "content": "哎哟，这可不像有冒险精神的雷姆必拓人说的话哦~",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4235_thumpy_blink",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "麦尼尔先生",
            "content": "你说什么？！",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2351",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        },
        "subLines": [
          {
            "type": "camera_focus_position",
            "data": {
              "position": {
                "x": 17,
                "y": -0.4375,
                "z": -2.0625
              },
              "distance": 7,
              "duration": 0.5,
              "ease": "InOutSine"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "unit_animation",
            "data": {
              "id": "npc_001_agoldm_3",
              "animationName": "Angry",
              "pauseOnEnd": false
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "塔妮",
            "content": "我的奶奶就是为大家寻找生机的探路者，我最最佩服她了。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4235_thumpy_relieved",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "塔妮",
            "content": "不瞒您说，除了安洁莉娜，我们剩下几个都是第一次靠自己去那么远的地方。但我相信，只要迈开腿，总有一天会到达南境的。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4235_thumpy_relieved",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "麦尼尔先生",
            "content": "......真是，随你们的便吧！快走吧，趁泉水平静的时候。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2351",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "嘉辛塔",
            "content": "其实，麦尼尔先生，昨天我们听您的太太提起了你们的困境。与其被困住脚步，不如也考虑一下向太阳谷寻求支持？",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4237_jcinta",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        },
        "subLines": [
          {
            "type": "unit_animation",
            "data": {
              "id": "char_4237_jcinta_3",
              "animationName": "Interact",
              "pauseOnEnd": false
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "麦尼尔先生",
            "content": "那帮黄毛小子黄毛丫头？！",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2351",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        },
        "subLines": [
          {
            "type": "unit_animation",
            "data": {
              "id": "npc_001_agoldm_3",
              "animationName": "Angry",
              "pauseOnEnd": false
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "嘉辛塔",
            "content": "您先别生气——我的意思是，如果移动平台的资源不够走太远的话，尽量让平台往那里走走，说不定会有收获的。他们的探矿师很厉害，选址也很有讲究。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4237_jcinta",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        },
        "subLines": [
          {
            "type": "unit_animation",
            "data": {
              "id": "char_4237_jcinta",
              "animationName": "Shock",
              "pauseOnEnd": false
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "塔妮",
            "content": "毕竟我们是雷姆必拓人，不会因为害怕而驻足不前的，对吧~",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_4235_thumpy_softsmile",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "麦尼尔先生",
            "content": "（深吸一口气）小屁孩！你以为这样就会刺激到我吗？！",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2351",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        },
        "subLines": [
          {
            "type": "unit_animation",
            "data": {
              "id": "npc_001_agoldm_3",
              "animationName": "Angry",
              "pauseOnEnd": false
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "content": "好啦好啦，两边都不要激动——我想是因为在荒野中遇到了温暖的人，就会忍不住期待二位的生活能变得好起来。但是，二位真正想要怎样的生活，不是我们应该插手的事。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        },
        "subLines": [
          {
            "type": "unit_animation",
            "data": {
              "id": "avatar_aglina_3",
              "animationName": "Skill_1_Loop_1",
              "pauseOnEnd": false
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "content": "只是，如果有能帮得到忙的地方，请麦尼尔先生太太一定开口，我们会尽我们所能的。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "麦尼尔太太",
            "content": "好，我也有种感觉，我们会再见面的。",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2352",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        },
        "subLines": [
          {
            "type": "unit_animation",
            "data": {
              "id": "npc_002_agoldw_3",
              "animationName": "Talk",
              "pauseOnEnd": false
            }
          }
        ]
      },
